{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/111325","id":2890809412,"node_id":"PR_kwDOAO6SJc6sTkBE","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/111325","diff_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/111325.diff","patch_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/111325.patch","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/111325","commits_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/111325/commits","review_comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/111325/comments","review_comment_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/comments{/number}","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/111325/comments","statuses_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/statuses/2fb310b1827e0a7f7d6b4c58a7cceab892f72602","number":111325,"state":"closed","locked":false,"title":"Make StateMachinePlayback set `Start` state as default in constructor","user":{"login":"TokageItLab","id":61938263,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjYxOTM4MjYz","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/61938263?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/TokageItLab","html_url":"https://github.com/TokageItLab","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TokageItLab/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TokageItLab/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TokageItLab/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TokageItLab/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TokageItLab/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TokageItLab/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TokageItLab/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TokageItLab/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TokageItLab/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"body":"- Fixes https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/111315\r\n\r\nThis is more of a StateMachine issue than a NodeOneShot issue.\r\n\r\nStateMachinePlayback does not have any states when it is generated.\r\n\r\nWhen StateMachine is not having state, a reset (seeking to the beginning) causes it to transition to the Start state. In other words, it does not transition to Start unless a reset occurs.\r\n\r\nWhile this could be resolved by having all Playbacks transition to Start beforehand, I believe setting the constructor Start as the default is fine.\r\n\r\nSince this involves a slight change in behavior, I'll add a break compat label. However, the only cases affected are those where the StateMachine is intentionally stopped, which is likely very niche; If such a case exists, the migration path would probably involve setting the Start transition property to something other than Auto or setting an advance expression.","labels":[{"id":73330064,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWw3MzMzMDA2NA==","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/bug","name":"bug","description":"","color":"ff6055","default":true,"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":955079684,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWw5NTUwNzk2ODQ=","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/breaks%20compat","name":"breaks compat","description":"","color":"b64245","default":false,"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":2666705648,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwyNjY2NzA1NjQ4","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/topic:animation","name":"topic:animation","description":"","color":"ffee88","default":false,"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null}],"milestone":{"id":12939969,"node_id":"MI_kwDOAO6SJc4AxXLB","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/milestones/23","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/milestone/23","labels_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/milestones/23/labels","number":23,"state":"closed","title":"4.6","description":"","creator":{"login":"Repiteo","id":17489292